# The deploy/log/ directory holds per-run log files written by
# deploy/lib/logger.sh (see docs/history/2026-10-06-deploy-script-logging-plan.md).
#
# This file is here only so git keeps the directory itself tracked;
# the files inside are matched by .gitignore and are never committed.
#
# Useful paths once you have run a deploy:
#   deploy/log/latest.log                 -> newest run (symlink or copy)
#   deploy/log/deploy-YYYYmmdd-HHMMSS-*.log  -> one file per run
